{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりました(´-ω-｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時すでにエクステにも飽き始めてしまった若月だよー(´-ω-｀)どうしようかな。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢新宿芸術天国2015」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢新宿スタイルコレクション｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNA SUI ✖️乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/10/28/3368668/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/10/28/3368668/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初ランウェイ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、路上にレッドカーペット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有り難き幸せ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洒落頑張ろう、女頑張ろうと思いました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46を起用してくださりありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、その日の夜はガールズアワードにも出演！！こちらはランウェイでは無く、LIVEパフォーマンスをさせていただきました(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも 可愛くて素敵なモデルさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山刺激を受けました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脚の長さがぁぁぁぁぁ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いーー！！と1人 騒いでおりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルさんて凄い。脚伸びないかなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいませ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"といいたいところですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ寝ません❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/10/28/3368668/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベマーズについて 書いてなかったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いたつもりでいたよ。ごめんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書かなきゃね。最近 記憶力の低下が著し過ぎて悩んでいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親が 『今買ってきたよ！！』と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"送ってきてくれた写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2015/10/28/3368668/0003.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}